# Burnout Bashtronaut: Menace; Start your engines! (CR 702.179); "{2}: +1/+0 until end of turn"; "Max speed — This creature
# has double strike" (CR 702.178a, 702.4). Cast on turn 1 it gives Bot1 speed 1 (CR 704.5aa). Bot2 has no creature, so the
# attacks on turns 3, 5 and 7 each make Bot2 lose life and raise the speed once (CR 702.179d): 2, 3, then 4 - and at speed 3
# it has menace only. The turn 7 hit takes it to max speed after the damage, so Bot2 is at 17 (one damage a turn). On
# turn 9 it has double strike: paying {2} once makes it 2/1, and it deals 2 in each damage step: 4, so Bot2 ends at 13.

